hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abdillah ibn Muhammad ibn Aqil amesema: Anas ibn Malik (Allah amridhie) alikuja Madina, na Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) alikuwa gavana wake. Umar alimtuma kwake kumuuliza kuhusu hadithi aliyoisimulia Hajjaj ibn Yusuf kuhusu watu waliotoka Madina wakavamia malisho; Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alituma jeshi likawakamata sita miongoni mwao: akawasulubisha wawili, akawakata viungo wawili, na akachoma macho ya wawili kwa vijiti vya moto. Anas (Allah amridhie) akasema: Watu hao walikuwa wamekubali Uislamu na kuhama, kisha wakauchukia Uislamu wakaritadi na kujiunga na maadui, basi ilikuwa halali kuwatendea hivyo. Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz alimtuma tena kwake akasema: Laiti usingemsimulia Hajjaj hadithi hii, kwani kitendo hiki kilifanywa kwa waliotoka Uislamuni na kujiunga na washirikina, ilhali Hajjaj amewafanyia watu ambao hawakutoka Uislamuni wala kujiunga na ushirikina. [Ibn Aqil] akasema: Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) aliniamrisha kumuuliza je, Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alikuwa akipaka hina? Anas akasema: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alifurahia weusi wa nywele; lau ungehesabu mvi za kichwa na ndevu zake zisingezidi ishirini, au akasema: usingepata hata nywele kumi nyeupe."
"7","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Anas (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliwasalisha watu, punda akapita mbele yao. Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'ah akasema: ((Subhana Allahi wa bihamdihi)). Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipomaliza sala akasema: ((Nani aliyesema Subhana Allahi wa bihamdihi hivi punde?)) Ayyash akasema: Mimi, ewe Mtume wa Allah; nimesikia kwamba punda hukata sala. Akasema: ((Hakuna kitu kinachokata sala))."
"8","[AI-translation] Hafidh Abu al-Husayn ibn al-Muzaffar amesema: Muhammad ibn Musa al-Hadrami alitusimulia, akasema: Ibrahim ibn Munqidh alitusimulia, akasema: Idris ibn Yahya alitusimulia, na akasimulia kwa sanad yake mfano wa [hadithi] iliyotangulia."
"9","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Ayyash ibn Abi Rabi'ah al-Makhzumi amesema: Siku moja Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) aliwasalisha Masahaba wake, punda akapita mbele yetu. Ayyash akasema: ((Subhana Allah)). Mtume (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alipomaliza akasema: ((Nani miongoni mwenu aliyesema Subhana Allah?)) Ayyash akasema: Mimi, ewe Mtume wa Allah; nimesikia kwamba punda hukata sala. Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akasema: ((Hakuna kitu kinachokata sala))."
